Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [debug-only]

kmsdrm/video driver-selection debug logging, temporary for RPi5 kmsdrm
bring-up. Elevates the previously-silent/LogDebug-only branches in
SDL_VideoInit's driver-selection loop and kmsdrm's get_driindex() (DRM
master denial, unusable connectors, per-device open/resource failures,
final "nothing found" summary) to SDL_LogError so they show on stderr by
default with no SDL_LOGGING hint needed. Also logs the real
SDL_GetError() from SDL_EGL_LoadLibrary() in KMSDRM_CreateWindow() before
it gets overwritten by the generic "Can't load EGL/GL library on window
creation." error. Drop this patch once the kmsdrm bring-up issues are
diagnosed.

